  "final_text": "All 3 tests pass.\n\n**Root cause:** `ledger/importers/csv_importer.py` hardcoded `amount_minor = int(amount * 100)` for every currency, ignoring ISO 4217 exponents — JPY/ISK/KRW (0 decimals) imports came out 100× too large, and KWD (3 decimals) would have been 10× off.\n\n**Fix:** replaced it with the project's existing helper `to_minor_units(amount, currency)` (also used by the JSON and QIF importers). Nothing else changed; USD/EUR, JSON, storage and reports keep their behaviour, and KWD now scales correctly.\n\nChanged file: `ledger/importers/csv_importer.py`",
